  <text>
    <body>
      <div>
        <head>In the directories</head>
        <p>J. Anderson, boarding-house keeper, is listed at No. 57 <ref target="civic?id=Madeline%20Street">Madeline Street</ref> in 1905.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>On the electoral roll</head>
        <p>John Anderson, boarding-house keeper, is on the 1905 <ref target="civic?id=Electoral-Rolls">electoral roll</ref> at 57 Madeline Street. There are other John Andersons in the records, so only these two listings are taken to be him.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>Neighbours</head>
        <p>Wm. McMahon, tailor, is at No. 55, and <ref target="civic?id=Patrick%20F.%20Dorgan">Patrick F. Dorgan</ref>, baker, at No. 59.</p>
      </div>
